exports[`iteration 4 brief: design first > opens a designApproved turn with the approval line and the proposal 1`] = `
"方案已批准，按方案实现
You are working on issue NP-12 "Fix login redirect".
It is a sub-issue (stage 2) of NP-10 "Login overhaul".
Run: 7301234567890123. Read the issue first: \`nocoproject issue get NP-12 --json\`
Then catch up on comments: \`nocoproject issue comment list NP-12 --json\`
The approved design proposal:
> ## 需求理解
> Fix the redirect.
> 
> ## 方案
